<title>PORTUGAL: PT, Telecel agree pricing.</title>
<headline>PT, Telecel agree pricing.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal Telecom and mobile phone operator Telecel have agreed on the prices that Telecel will pay for using PT's network and rented circuits effective from this month, a statement from the two companies said.</p>
<p>&quot;Telecel obtained a significant reduction in the prices that it has been paying to date,&quot; the statement said.</p>
<p>&quot;It is estimated that Telecel's purchase of services from PT in 1997 will cost some 12 billion escudos, above the 1996 level, given the likely increase in phone use,&quot; it added.</p>
<p>The statement gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
